            <title>[LU-15764] parallel-scale test ior_mdtest_parallel_fpp: Test appears to complete successfully, fails after very long timeout</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-15764</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Cliff White &amp;lt;cwhite@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/0d0c20a7-a3a0-4a2c-a835-f2d6a885c25d" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/0d0c20a7-a3a0-4a2c-a835-f2d6a885c25d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think this may be a script issue - seen on multiple test runs:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Error: 'Timeout occurred after 460 minutes, last suite running was parallel-scale'&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Examination of the test log shows the last IOR test does complete, but the test script does not resume. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
